    "text": "空",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009011040170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　空です！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200901104/2009011040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺にはいつもと同じ空に見えるけど……\r\n何か違うのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009011040180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ！\r\nえっと、空はいつもどおりなんですけど……っ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901104/2009011040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009011040190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "理科の教科書で見た時、宇宙が黒かったんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901104/2009011040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009011040200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、今あたしが見てる空は青くて、\r\nでも、空がずっとずっと上に行くと宇宙になって",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901104/2009011040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009011040210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……でも\r\n空から下は──空気は、透明なんです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901104/2009011040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009011040220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そう思ったら……\r\nどこから青くなって、どこから黒くなるのかなって",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901104/2009011040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどなぁ……\r\nどこからが空で宇宙なのか、ってことか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "考えたこともなかったよ\r\n難しい問題だな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009011040230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901104/2009011040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009011040240,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんでも難しいですか！？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901104/2009011040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nなんだろうな、概念みたいな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "宇宙は大気圏を抜けたら、とかなのかな\r\n空……空は……うーん……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "果穂はどこからが\r\n空だと思うんだ？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
